---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Marketing Execution"
  description="Local SEO, paid ads, web optimization, and lead generation systems for service businesses in Golden, CO and the Front Range. ZeisWorks handles the campaigns. You handle the calls."
  ogTitle="Marketing Execution | zeisWorks"
  ogDescription="Marketing that runs and learns. Local SEO, paid ads, web optimization, and lead generation systems for Golden and Front Range businesses."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 space-y-16">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-orange uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">01 / Marketing</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-semibold text-ink leading-tight">
        Marketing execution
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-mid text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        Marketing that runs and learns. Local SEO, paid ads, web optimization, and the systems that bring in the right leads. I handle the campaigns. You handle the calls.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-modal="gap-analysis"
          class="bg-navy text-cream text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-navy/90 transition-colors font-medium cursor-pointer border-0"
        >
          Get in touch
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-modal="gap-analysis"
          class="border border-navy text-navy text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-navy/5 transition-colors font-medium cursor-pointer"
        >
          Talk through your situation →
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- What's included -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-6">What's included</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-4">
        {[
          { title: 'Local SEO', body: 'Google Business Profile setup and optimization, local citation building, review management, and on-page SEO for service-area businesses.' },
          { title: 'Paid ads management', body: 'Google Ads and Meta campaigns scoped to your budget. Setup, copy, targeting, and ongoing optimization. No set-it-and-forget-it.' },
          { title: 'Website optimization', body: 'Conversion rate improvements, page speed, lead capture forms, and copy that matches what your customers are actually searching for.' },
          { title: 'Lead generation systems', body: 'Outbound sequences, lead lists, and the CRM workflow that makes sure leads don\'t fall through the cracks after they come in.' },
          { title: 'Reporting and visibility', body: 'A dashboard that shows what\'s working and what isn\'t. Not a vanity metrics report: actual cost per lead, source attribution, and trend data.' },
        ].map(item => (
          <li class="flex gap-4 items-start">
            <span class="mt-1.5 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange shrink-0"></span>
            <div>
              <strong class="text-ink font-medium">{item.title}.</strong>{' '}
              <span class="text-ink-mid">{item.body}</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Who it's for -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4">Who it's for</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-mid leading-relaxed mb-4">
        This pillar is the right fit if your business depends on inbound leads and you don't have a dedicated marketing person. Common clients:
      </p>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
        {['Home services (HVAC, plumbing, electrical, roofing)', 'Healthcare and dental practices', 'Professional services (law, accounting, insurance)', 'Real estate and property management', 'Trades and contractors'].map(sector => (
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-cream-dark bg-cream p-4 text-sm text-ink-mid">{sector}</div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Outcomes -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-ink mb-4">What outcomes look like</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-ink-mid leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          A $3M HVAC company spending $2,000/month on Google Ads with no tracking in place is burning money. Three months into a properly structured campaign with conversion tracking, they know their cost per call, which keywords convert, and which service areas are worth targeting. The budget doesn't change. The returns do.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most businesses in this situation aren't failing at marketing because they're doing it wrong. They're failing because they don't have the time or visibility to do it consistently. That's the gap ZeisWorks fills. The campaigns run, the reports are readable, and you know where your leads are coming from.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy/20 bg-navy/5 p-8">
      <p class="text-xs text-navy uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Start here</p>
      <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2">See what your marketing looks like right now.</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink-mid mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        The free 5-minute marketing analysis shows where leads are coming from, what's missing, and what's worth fixing. No commitment, no sales call.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-modal="gap-analysis"
          class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream text-sm px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-navy/90 transition-colors cursor-pointer border-0"
        >
          Get in touch
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          data-modal="gap-analysis"
          class="inline-block text-navy text-sm px-5 py-2.5 font-medium hover:underline cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent"
        >
          Or tell me what you're trying to fix →
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Back -->
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-light">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">← Back to home</a>
      &nbsp;·&nbsp;
      <a href="/operations" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Operations →</a>
    </p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
